# Components

UI (`src/components/ui/`) = atoms. No dictionaries, no routes, no locale.

Templates (`src/components/templates/`) = compose UI. Copy and `currentLocale` arrive as props.

Icons (`src/components/icons/`) = SVG glyphs and flags. Import `@/components/icons`. Do not put glyphs in `ui/` or `templates/`. Linear only (`viewBox="0 0 24 24"`, `stroke="currentColor"`, width 1.5). Register names in `registry.ts`.

Each UI/template is a folder: `<name>.tsx` + `index.ts`. Export the component, props type, and `*Variants` when using `cva`. Button `icon` is an `IconName`; icon-only uses equal padding (CVA `iconOnly` compounds that override `md:px-*`). Higher UI atoms compose lower ones: Dropdown uses Button + Card for trigger and panel (`role="menu"`); SelectMenu and Combobox use Select field chrome + Card listbox (`role="listbox"`; Combobox adds an Input search in the panel); SideMenu and Popup use Button + Card slots (`*Header` / `Content` / `Footer`); Alert is a Card; TabsTrigger is a Button; Tooltip’s panel is a Card; do not duplicate chrome styles.

```tsx
// BAD — copy inside UI, no className merge, hex / arbitrary radius
export function Button() {
  return <button className="ml-2 rounded-[10px] bg-[#171717]">Language</button>;
}

// GOOD — props, cn(), logical CSS, token variants
export function Button({ className, ...props }: ButtonProps) {
  return <button className={cn(buttonVariants(), className)} {...props} />;
}
```

Do not change existing prop APIs without user confirmation. Adding a new Card/Heading that follows this pattern does not need confirmation. Shared visual tokens: `rounded-none|xs|sm|md|lg|xl|full`, `border-none|sm|md|lg`, `border-border`, `bg-panel`, `bg-primary`, `bg-accent-1`…`4`, `bg-success`, `bg-warning`, `bg-error` plus `*-foreground` / `*-hover` / `*-glow` / `*-shadow` (glow and shadow on action colors), `max-w-container-xs`…`xl` — no hex, no `rounded-[…]`, no `getSettings()` in UI. Mobile-first: base styles are the small screen; scale with `xs:` `sm:` `md:` `lg:` `xl:`; flex children that shrink need `min-w-0`. Update [docs/components.md](docs/components.md) when the inventory changes; if the Layout summary in `CLAUDE.md` would be stale, update it in the same turn. Update the lab in the same turn: `src/dev/meta`, playground renderer, permutation gallery (UI → `/dev/components/[slug]`, templates → `/dev/templates/[slug]`, icons → `/dev/icons`).
